/T (A simple keyword-based classifier labelled all 28 classroom messages correctly \(100%\), and every decision could be explained by listing the matched words. Rule-based AI is valuable because it is transparent, quick to build and gives analysts a clear reason for each alert. Its limitation is that it only knows the words it was given: it misses synonyms and new attack wording, and it flags harmless text that uses warning words. Therefore, it should support, not replace, a human analyst. The final table was saved as Lab1_Final_Result.csv.)
/E (A simple keyword-based classifier labelled all 28 classroom messages correctly \(100%\), and every decision could be explained by listing the matched words. Rule-based AI is valuable because it is transparent, quick to build and gives analysts a clear reason for each alert. Its limitation is that it only knows the words it was given: it misses synonyms and new attack wording, and it flags harmless text that uses warning words. Therefore, it should support, not replace, a human analyst. The final table was saved as Lab1_Final_Result.csv.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [30]
>>
endobj
