/Title (My manual labels match the correct_category column for all ten messages. Each threat message has at least two indicators: phishing uses urgency and credential words \(urgent, verify, password, OTP, bank, prize, login\); malware names harmful files \(trojan, spyware, executable, attachment, infected\); ransomware mentions encryption, ransom, bitcoin and locked files.)
