658 0 obj
<<
/Title (The function converts the message to lowercase, counts how many keywords of each category appear in it, and returns the category with the highest score. If every score is zero it returns Safe. The first test reproduces the manual's example output \(Phishing, 4 keywords\). Because every decision is a visible count of matched words, the result is easy to explain.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 601 0 R
/Next 659 0 R
>>
endobj
