748 0 obj
<<
/Title (The classifier got 28 of 28 correct \(100%\), matching the manual's expectation. This is optimistic because the dataset is small and clean, and the keyword lists were written with these very messages in mind, so the test is partly a test on the training examples. Real messages contain spelling tricks, synonyms, other languages and mixed content that the rules never saw. A false positive is a Safe message labelled as a threat; a false negative is a threat labelled Safe. Both are possible on real data even though neither occurred here. High accuracy on this classroom set does not prove real-world effectiveness.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 717 0 R
>>
endobj
